cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use codopex in your research, please cite the accompanying paper (see preferred-citation)."
title: "codopex: symmetry-inequivalent co-doping defect-complex generation"
abstract: >-
  codopex generates symmetry-inequivalent substitutional co-doping defect
  complexes (pairs and triples) in a host supercell, using pure
  pymatgen/spglib symmetry analysis and exporting POSCAR trees for VASP.
